# Documentation rules

- Update README and docs when user-facing behavior changes.
- Document new IPC commands in docs/architecture.md.
- Schema changes require docs/database.md + a numbered SQL migration.
- Prefer short concrete examples over long prose.
- Never add AI/tool branding to product docs.
